        "relative_time_description": "in the last week",
        "text": "\"I'm absolutely obsessed with P. C.Chandra jewellers.Their customer service is top-notch - the staff is knowledgeable, friendly, and always willing to go the extra mile. The collection is stunning, with a wide range of designs that cater to every taste and preference. From traditional to modern, their gold jewelry pieces are truly works of art.\n\nWhat impresses me the most is their attention to detail and commitment to quality.\nI've purchased from them multiple times, and every experience has been wonderful. The packaging is elegant, and the after-sales service is excellent. If you're looking for a reliable and trustworthy gold jewelry brand, look no further than p c chandra . Five stars isn't enough - I'd give them ten stars if I could!\"",
